},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Similarity\/documentation\/Similarity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/simRankSimilarity(importanceFactor:tolerance:maxIterations:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"SimRank (Jeh and Widom): two vertices are similar when their neighbors are similar.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"simRankSimilarity","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"importanceFactor","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 0.9, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tolerance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 1e-4, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 1000) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NoConvergence","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/NoConvergence","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SimRankSimilarity","identifier":"doc:\/\/Similarity\/documentation\/Similarity\/SimRankSimilarity","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Similarity07SimRankA0V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"DirectedView","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedView","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols12DirectedViewV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">>","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"importanceFactor","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"C, the decay applied to each step away from the pair.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"tolerance","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The largest change in any similarity that counts as converged.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"maxIterations","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The most steps to take."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every pair’s similarity, symmetric, with 1 on the diagonal."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"S(A, a) = 1, and for a ≠ b, s(a, b) = C \/ (|Γ(a)| |Γ(b)|) · Σ s(i, j) over i ∈ Γ(a) and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"j ∈ Γ(b), or 0 when a or b has no neighbor, where Γ(x) is the set of neighbors of x: parallel"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edges count once, and a vertex with a self-loop is its own neighbor. The iteration starts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from s(a, b) = 0 for a ≠ b and stops after the first step whose largest change in any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"similarity is below "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance"},{"type":"text","text":". O(n (n + m)) per step and O(n²) memory, for n vertices and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"m edges."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"importanceFactor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is between 0 and 1, exclusive; ","type":"text"},{"code":"tolerance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is positive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and finite; ","type":"text"},{"code":"maxIterations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is at least 1.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Precondition","type":"aside","style":"note"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NoConvergence"},{"type":"text","text":" when no step of the first "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"type":"text","text":" changes every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"similarity by less than "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance"},{"type":"text","text":", with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"type":"text","text":" and the last step’s largest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change."}]}],"name":"Throws","type":"aside","style":"note"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/similarity\/graphprotocols\/graph\/simranksimilarity(importancefactor:tolerance:maxiterations:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://Similarity/documentation/Similarity/GraphProtocols/Graph/simRankSimilarity(importanceFactor:tolerance:maxIterations:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"simRankSimilarity"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"importanceFactor"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tolerance"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"maxIterations"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NoConvergence"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Similarity07SimRankA0V","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SimRankSimilarity"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier